Bugs fixed, all in `src/` only:
- `auth.py`: `has_permission` was case-sensitive; `is_admin_or_owner` used `and` instead of `or`.
- `inventory.py`: shared mutable default dict in `__init__`; `add` overwrote instead of accumulating; `reserve` rejected `qty == available`; `release` allowed going negative.
- `text_utils.py`: `slugify` didn't lowercase and only collapsed `--` once (leaving odd runs); `truncate` counted the suffix on top of `max_len`.
